Weak.\n- **Candidate 3:** about 1.1× on both. Good.\n- **Candidate 6:** about 1.16× on item 0 and 1.05× on item 1. Good.\n- **Candidate 0:** about 1.2–1.25×. Storage costs build up, but shortages stay low. Probably good.\n- **Candidate 7:** about 1.1–1.15×, on odd days. It pays one more 56 fee than the every-2-days plans (14 orders instead of 13), which is minor. Good.\n- **Candidate 2:** exactly the forecast on item 0 and about 1.29× on item 1. It goes short on item 0 and holds a lot of item 1. Borderline, so I gave it 0.35.\n- **Candidate 5:** orders every 3 days at exactly the forecast. Skipping 4 order fees saves about 224. Holding roughly a day's extra stock costs about 420, though. The day-12 delivery (95 + 65 plus leftovers) may also overflow the 168-unit warehouse. Weak.\n- **Candidate 4:** orders every day, which costs 27 × 56 = 1512 in fees. That is about 780 more than the every-2-days plans. Weak."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5058, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5058}, "output_tokens": 10, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:41:03.205Z", "request_id": "req_011CgW9ePi9xYkn11JbmJDAF"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01L8VdL9KHyBRuvcE7V2WCFi", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgW9ePz2TCut1PF1ALmDg", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "conte